  "term": "inhalant abuse",
  "definition": "Inhalant abuse is the illegal use of chemical products or substances by breathing in their vapors to quickly change mental state. It commonly involves aerosols, gases, or volatile solvents, and the inhaling may be repeated to maintain a brief intoxicating effect.",
